        "action_date": "2026-02-12",
        "action_desc": "Introduced in House",
        "text": "<p><b>Plastic Pellet Free Waters Act</b></p> <p>This bill requires the Environmental Protection Agency to issue a final rule that prohibits certain discharges of plastic pellets and other preproduction plastic into waters of the United States.</p>",
